   need 1 byte scidLen; if scidLen > 20 → BAD_HEADER; need scidLen bytes
   if level == I: read varint tokenLen (need enough bytes); need tokenLen bytes → token
   read varint length (need enough bytes) → len
   if (len < pnWidth) BAD_HEADER
   if (len > wire.length - p) BAD_HEADER
   pn bytes = wire[p .. p+pnWidth); payload = wire[p+pnWidth .. p+len)
   nextPos = p + len
}
```
